  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LayerZeroV2OASIS v2.0.3\n\nLayerZero V2 Cross-Chain Messaging Provider Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 9 new providers — 193 total (+cross-chain, +ZK identity, +Web3 infra) (94b5115)\n- feat: implement real API/SDK for all new providers (21 providers across 6 categories) (0d09c71)\n- feat(LayerZeroV2OASIS): track omnichain messages via the LayerZero Scan API (98fd434)\n- feat(StargateOASIS): quotes and transfers via the LayerZero Value Transfer API (ea1c690)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LayerZeroV2OASIS",
